{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_538d46c91e0c77de6e61fd85265c6a8dd3c3f83e5d77c5a424303c3aff083298","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"asheshgoplani/agent-deck@7d2302fb8a41 snapshot 5d1b37ace8d9fdef","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a5356988e5e33f173d66b748e37f5478b6fdc7d2aa270fcf6a5183e30ac24679","slc_f5b7486e1268734c884fc9b11a2c6b6ed7baf0756e8539a49a8ea415d1a1adaa"],"source_ids":["src_f336b6278b9559e28285acfeedc96a95"],"text":"Repository development practice: the project states every incoming pull request is validated - applied, built, and tested - within about a day, and points contributors to CONTRIBUTING.md and a pinned onboarding issue.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5db25d72190bd966017afcfbc976d6926a46a05b8b7082c6122b946ba8bc2c59","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"asheshgoplani/agent-deck@7d2302fb8a41 snapshot 5d1b37ace8d9fdef","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c7ad7fb140254a5ed1d5a32c44d8ab2f185c13e6ad0f59444976b4d97a8019b3","slc_fa6897cba77794ff138420356aa3f485f49e5fbb15cb83758bfc1e2a1b618e59"],"source_ids":["src_f336b6278b9559e28285acfeedc96a95"],"text":"A documented worktree-setup script runs automatically once a worktree is created, under a 60-second timeout; if the script fails, documentation states the worktree is still created and only a warning is shown, rather than the session being blocked.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70f4b0d5f44843c0dd4bc024cdcdb29bc44ff9c048174e8026a6843e8af78840","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"asheshgoplani/agent-deck@7d2302fb8a41 snapshot 5d1b37ace8d9fdef","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1fb17e274f3e1521366e40c96e1353e970cca206d65ce36c916992e79058ed46","slc_dede137c8ceb09bc1d6e3a89ac2e69e1d3cf421e5b1ea0411ee0452769916499"],"source_ids":["src_f336b6278b9559e28285acfeedc96a95"],"text":"Documentation states each session's git worktree is an isolated working directory on its own branch, letting multiple agents work on one repository without conflicting, and a dedicated command merges the branch, removes the worktree, and deletes the session once a task is finished.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9372a6bcf64f44f4a5ae781885ac7217"}
